   ╭─[ reject/partial-escape.sw:6:65 ]
   │
 6 │ def retry (n : Nat) : {Partial} (Nat -> {Partial} Nat) := \x => retry (n - 1) x
   │                                                                 ───────┬───────  
   │                                                                        ╰───────── this calls `retry`, but it's returned or stored where nothing can run the call
